  "label": "The number 666 is mapped onto the Black man as his 'chemical make up'",
  "description": "The top text '666 6 protons 6 neutrons 6 elektrons' is presented as a scientific fact, but it is falsely applied to the Black man in the image, implying that his biological composition is identical to the atomic structure of carbon. This is a racist pseudoscience claim that dehumanizes Black people by equating them with a chemical element. The visual material (the Black man) is thus mapped onto the textual claim (666 = chemical make up of black people).",
